    "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu), for creating the [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) Android app for OGS and making it open source. The process of creating this Android app, along with the project itself have been great reference materials for me during development." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu) für die Entwicklung der quelloffenen OGS-Android-App [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo). Sowohl der Entwicklungsprozess als auch das Projekt selbst waren für mich während der Entwicklung wertvolle Referenzen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A [**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu), por crear la app para Android [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) para OGS y publicarla como código abierto. Tanto el proceso de creación de esta app para Android como el proyecto en sí han sido excelentes materiales de referencia durante el desarrollo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu), pour la création du client OGS open-source [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) pour Android. Le procédé de création de cette application ainsi que du projet en tant que tel ont étés une précieuse aide pour moi pendant le développement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[「**Sente**」](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) というAndroid用アプリを作り、オープンソースで提供してくれて、[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu)にありがとうございます。このAndroidアプリのプロジェクトはSurroundの開発には大変参考なりました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OGS용 [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) Android 앱을 만들고 오픈 소스로 공개하여 개발에 훌륭한 참고 자료를 제공해 준 [**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu), por criar o app [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) para OGS no Android e disponibilizá-lo como código aberto. O processo de criação desse app Android e o próprio projeto foram ótimas referências durante o desenvolvimento."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A [**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu), por ter criado a app [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) para Android destinada ao OGS e por a ter disponibilizado como código aberto. O processo de criação desta app para Android, bem como o próprio projeto, foram excelentes materiais de referência para mim durante o desenvolvimento."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu) ผู้สร้างแอป [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) สำหรับ Android เพื่อใช้งาน OGS และเผยแพร่เป็นโอเพนซอร์ส ทั้งกระบวนการสร้างแอปและตัวโครงการเป็นแหล่งอ้างอิงที่ยอดเยี่ยมระหว่างการพัฒนา"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu), tác giả của ứng dụng mã nguồn mở [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) cho Android. Trong quá trình phát triển Surround đã có tham khảo rất nhiều từ Sente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢 [**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu) 为 OGS 开发并开源 [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo) Android 应用。该应用的开发过程和项目本身都为我的开发工作提供了宝贵参考。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Alexandru Cristescu**](https://github.com/acristescu)，感謝他開發並開源 OGS Android 應用程式 [**Sente**](https://github.com/acristescu/OnlineGo)。這款 Android 應用程式的開發過程與專案本身，在 Surround 開發期間提供了寶貴的參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me), for creating the app icon, and providing design advises for the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me) für die Gestaltung des App-Symbols und die Designberatung für die App."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A [**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me), por crear el icono de la app y aportar consejos sobre su diseño."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me), pour la création de l'icône de l'application et pour ses conseils de conception."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アップ・アイコンの作成とデザインのご相談は、[**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me)さんにご提供いいただきました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱 아이콘을 만들고 디자인 조언을 제공해 준 [**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me), por criar o ícone do app e oferecer orientações de design."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A [**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me), por ter criado o ícone da app e pelas sugestões de design."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Linh Pham**](https://linhpham.me) ผู้สร้างไอคอนแอปและให้คำแนะนำด้านการออกแบบ"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
