    "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), for kickstarting the effort to translate this app to multiple languages, and for translating the app to Japanese." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php) für den Anstoß, diese App in mehrere Sprachen zu übersetzen, sowie für die Übersetzung der App ins Japanische und Französische."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), for kickstarting the effort to translate this app to multiple languages, and for translating the app to Japanese and French."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A [**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), por impulsar la traducción de esta app a varios idiomas y por traducirla al japonés y al francés."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), pour la mise en branle de l'effort de traduction de l'application en plusieurs langues ainsi que pour les traductions japonaise et française."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php)は、このアプリの翻訳を開始して、日本語とフランス語の翻訳を提供しました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다국어 번역을 시작하고 일본어와 프랑스어 번역을 제공해 준 [**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php)에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), por dar início ao esforço de tradução deste app para vários idiomas e por traduzi-lo para japonês e francês."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A [**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), por ter impulsionado a tradução desta app para vários idiomas e por a ter traduzido para japonês e francês."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php) ผู้ริเริ่มการแปลแอปเป็นหลายภาษา และแปลแอปเป็นภาษาญี่ปุ่นและฝรั่งเศส"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php), người bắt đầu quá trình dịch Surround ra các ngôn ngữ khác, và giúp dịch Surround sang tiếng Nhật và tiếng Pháp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢 [**Raphaël Assenat**](https://www.raphnet.net/index_en.php) 推动本应用的多语言翻译工作，并完成日语翻译。"
          }
