    "Everyone who participated in the [beta testing](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437), for helping me to improve the app with many feedbacks and bug reports." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allen, die am [Betatest](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437) teilgenommen und mir mit zahlreichen Rückmeldungen und Fehlerberichten geholfen haben, die App zu verbessern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A todas las personas que participaron en las [pruebas beta](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437), por ayudarme a mejorar la app con sus numerosos comentarios e informes de errores."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tous les participants du [test beta](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437), pour m'avoir aidé à améliorer l'application et pour de nombreux commentaires et rapports d'erreur."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[ベタ版をテスト](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437)の皆さんからのフィードバックとバッグレポートが大変助かりました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "많은 의견과 오류 보고로 앱 개선을 도와준 [베타 테스트](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437) 참가자 모두에게 감사드립니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos os que participaram dos [testes beta](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437), por me ajudarem a melhorar o app com muitos comentários e relatos de bugs."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A todos os que participaram nos [testes beta](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437), por me ajudarem a melhorar a app com inúmeros comentários e relatórios de erros."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ทุกคนที่ร่วม [ทดสอบเบต้า](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437) และช่วยปรับปรุงแอปด้วยคำติชมและรายงานข้อผิดพลาดมากมาย"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Những người tham gia quá trình [test beta](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437) ứng dụng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢所有参与[测试](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437)的人，大家提供的大量反馈和错误报告帮助我不断改进本应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有參與[測試版測試](https://forums.online-go.com/t/surround-ios-client-for-ogs/34437) 的人，感謝你們提供眾多意見與錯誤回報，協助我改進本應用程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
