    "The **Online Go Server** (OGS) is a popular server to play Go online, accessed by visiting https://online-go.com. OGS features a modern user interface and a friendly, welcoming community of Go players." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der **Online Go Server** (OGS) ist ein beliebter Server zum Online-Go-Spielen und unter https://online-go.com erreichbar. OGS bietet eine moderne Benutzeroberfläche und eine freundliche, einladende Gemeinschaft von Go-Spielern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server** (OGS) es un popular servidor para jugar al Go en línea, disponible en https://online-go.com. OGS cuenta con una interfaz moderna y una comunidad de jugadores de Go amable y acogedora."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server** (OGS) est un serveur populaire pour jouer au Go en ligne accessible en visitant https://online-go.com. OGS présente une interface usager moderne et une communauté amicale et accueillante de joueurs de Go."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server** (OGS)は、使いやすいインテーフェスとフレンドリーなユーザーのあるインタネット囲碁サーバーです。https://online-go.comでアクセスができます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server**(OGS)는 https://online-go.com에서 이용할 수 있는 인기 온라인 바둑 서버입니다. 현대적인 사용자 인터페이스와 친절하고 따뜻한 바둑 커뮤니티를 제공합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O **Online Go Server** (OGS) é um servidor popular para jogar Go online, acessível em https://online-go.com. O OGS oferece uma interface moderna e uma comunidade de jogadores de Go simpática e acolhedora."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O **Online Go Server** (OGS) é um servidor popular para jogar Go online, disponível em https://online-go.com. O OGS oferece uma interface moderna e uma comunidade de jogadores de Go simpática e acolhedora."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server** (OGS) เป็นเซิร์ฟเวอร์ยอดนิยมสำหรับเล่นหมากล้อมออนไลน์ เข้าใช้งานได้ที่ https://online-go.com OGS มีส่วนติดต่อผู้ใช้ที่ทันสมัยและชุมชนผู้เล่นหมากล้อมที่เป็นมิตร"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server** (OGS) là một website chơi Cờ Vây online nổi tiếng, có thể truy cập tại địa chỉ https://online-go.com. OGS có giao diện dễ sử dụng và một cộng đồng thân thiện."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server**（OGS）是广受欢迎的在线围棋服务器，可通过 https://online-go.com 访问。OGS 拥有现代化的用户界面，以及友好、热情的围棋社区。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Online Go Server**（OGS）是廣受歡迎的線上圍棋伺服器，可透過 https://online-go.com 使用。OGS 擁有現代化的使用者介面，以及友善、熱情的圍棋社群。"
          }
        }
      }
